'''All Gamers''' (often abbreviated '''AG''') is a [[:Category:China|Chinese]] esports organization based in [[wikipedia:Chengdu|Chengdu]]. It was originally a ''StarCraft II'' team, but later became well-known for its success in ''CrossFire''.

